# Dryad Militant's replacement covers an instant or sorcery card put into a graveyard "from anywhere" (CR 614.1a), a library
# included, and only those. Bot1's Thought Scour mills its own Lightning Bolt and Grizzly Bears: the Bolt is exiled, the Bears (a
# creature card) goes to the graveyard, and the Thought Scour itself is exiled as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Dryad Militant
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dryad Militant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Thought Scour
